1. Create a Ganache Workspace
Step 1 — Open Ganache

Open the Ganache GUI application.

Step 2 — Create New Workspace

Click "New Workspace"

Click "Ethereum"

Select "Add Project"

Choose your smart contract project folder:

your_project/smartcontract/

Step 3 — Configure RPC Server

Leave default settings:

RPC Server: http://127.0.0.1:7545
Network ID: 5777

Step 4 — Save Workspace

Click "SAVE WORKSPACE" (top-right).

Ganache automatically generates:

10 Ethereum accounts

Each with 100 ETH test balance

Each with public address + private key

These will be used for:

Purpose	Ganache Account
Admin / Contract Owner	Account #1
User MetaMask (User1)	Account #2
User MetaMask (User2)	Account #3
# ################################################################
2. Create a MetaMask Wallet
Step 1 — Install MetaMask

Install the MetaMask extension in any browser (Chrome, Edge, Opera).

Step 2 — Create a New Wallet

Click Create Wallet

Set a password

Save your Secret Recovery Phrase (important for your security)

You now have an empty MetaMask wallet.
# ################################################################
3. Connect MetaMask to Ganache (Local Blockchain)
Step 1 — Add a Custom Network

In MetaMask:

Click Network Dropdown

Click Add Network

Choose Add a Network Manually

Enter the following:

Setting	Value
Network Name	Ganache Local
RPC URL	http://127.0.0.1:7545

Chain ID	1337 (or 5777 depending on Ganache)
Currency Symbol	ETH

Click Save.

MetaMask is now connected to your Ganache blockchain.
# ################################################################
4. Import Ganache Accounts Into MetaMask

Ganache gives 10 accounts.
Each has a private key.
You can import them into MetaMask to simulate real users.

Step 1 — Copy Ganache Private Key

In Ganache:

Click account Key icon

Click Copy Private Key

Step 2 — Import into MetaMask

In MetaMask:

Click your account icon → Import Account

Paste the Ganache private key

The Ganache account (with 100 ETH balance) now appears in MetaMask.

# ################################################################

